Author: TimLavelle <tim+1@lavelle.bio>
Date:   Mon Aug 24 12:31:41 2026 +1000

    fix(storybook): define WEBPACK_TARGET so ssr-config resolves the browser-safe branch

    pwa-kit-runtime's ssr-config.js picks ssr-config.server.js (Node-only,
    pulls in cosmiconfig's fs/os/module deps) unless WEBPACK_TARGET === 'web'.
    The real app build sets this via pwa-kit-dev's own DefinePlugin;
    .storybook/main.js never did, so any story importing config/contentful.ts's
    getConfig() (e.g. footer/index.stories.tsx) broke the browser bundle with
    "Module not found: fs/os/module" errors.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JGufQTc5rhNzFUksUURiM7

